   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "The numerator N = x^2 e^x is a product, so N' = 2x e^x + x^2 e^x = (x^2 + 2x) e^x, and the denominator D = x^2 + 1 has D' = 2x.",
         "mathjson": [
            "Multiply",
            [
               "Add",
               [
                  "Power",
                  "x",
                  2
               ],
               [
                  "Multiply",
                  2,
                  "x"
               ]
            ],
            [
               "Exp",
               "x"
            ]
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "The quotient rule gives r'(x) = (D N' - N D')/D^2 = ((x^2 + 1)(x^2 + 2x) e^x - x^2 e^x (2x))/(x^2 + 1)^2.",
         "mathjson": [
