                  1
               ],
               2
            ]
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "Expand: (x^2 + 1)(x^2 + 2x) = x^4 + 2x^3 + x^2 + 2x, and subtracting 2x^3 leaves x^4 + x^2 + 2x, so r'(x) = e^x (x^4 + x^2 + 2x)/(x^2 + 1)^2.",
